    <section class="section">
        <h2>Make it yours &mdash; build a custom surface</h2>

        <p>Notes is just the first surface. Everything lives in an open vault your AI can read and write, so you can build a UI shaped to <em>your</em> brain &mdash; a dashboard, a daily journal, a garden &mdash; and host it on the same hub. <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@openparachute/surface-client" target="_blank"><code>@openparachute/surface-client</code></a> gives you auth + the vault API, and <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@openparachute/surface-render" target="_blank"><code>surface-render</code></a> renders your notes &mdash; a working surface in a few lines.</p>

